# Shrinking the terminal while the Navigator is open keeps its focused entry in view, and growing it back shows the full list.
file <<END
Alpha:
	- a
Omega:
	- z
END
keys <C-g> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down>
see │▌ Omega
resize 30 7
see │▌ Omega
hide Today
resize 100 30
see 󰖙 Today
see │▌ Omega
keys <Enter>
see 󰋜 › Omega
quit
